    <tags>brother pt-p700 ptp700 p-touch printer label driver hardware</tags>
    <summary>Windows printer driver for the Brother PT-P700 label printer.</summary>
    <description>Installs Brother's printer driver for the PT-P700 label printer.

This package installs only the printer driver. It does not install P-touch Editor, P-touch Update Software, or the Printer Setting Tool. Windows on ARM is not supported by the vendor.</description>
    <releaseNotes>Packaging metadata update: sets the package owner to seacrackersinception. Packages Brother Printer Driver 7.3.0d, released 17 February 2025.</releaseNotes>
